TITLE Calcite dissolution kinetics with Cu and Ba at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    redox     pe
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10
    Ba        5
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol   1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -si Witherite
END
